36
00:02:10.094 --> 00:02:15.310
He was cute and furry this morning. But now . . ." The woman cried.

37
00:02:15.310 --> 00:02:21.159
"He looks like a monster! Oh! Poor Ralphie!"

38
00:02:21.160 --> 00:02:24.026
"How did this happen?" asked Detective Smith.

39
00:02:24.026 --> 00:02:26.923
"Did Ralphie eat anything strange today?"

40
00:02:26.923 --> 00:02:29.913
